 to open panels |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Security notes"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- The panel channel (`/ssh/ws`) applies the harness browser-trust fence:\nloopback/trusted-host Host,"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" same-origin Origin, cross-site fetch-metadata\nrejection.\n- Secrets never leave the credential store"},{"id":"p25s3","text":": the records file holds\nreferences only; error messages are scrubbed; logs contain no secrets.\n- Co"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"mmands run through real PTYs on the remote host: ANSI output works,\ninteractive programs work, and t"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ermination is a genuine SIGINT to the\nforeground process group. User keystrokes flow through the sha"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"red shell's\nPTY; while an AI command runs on a connection the host drops keystrokes\n(input mutex — t"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"he user may only type when the AI is not executing on that\nterminal)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

